Third-party software
--------------------

No third-party files are included in this repository. The six container
images are built from these projects, each under its own license:

  - Debian (base of the dns and browser images), various free licenses
  - Unbound, BSD-3-Clause
  - SearXNG, AGPL-3.0 (its own image, used unchanged apart from settings.yml)
  - Squid (via the ubuntu/squid image), GPL-2.0
  - Chromium, BSD-3-Clause and others
  - TigerVNC, GPL-2.0; noVNC, MPL-2.0; websockify, LGPL-3.0; Openbox, GPL-2.0
  - nginx, BSD-2-Clause
  - Python 3, PSF License

The Python program in mcp/ installs these packages (see mcp/pyproject.toml):

  - mcp (MIT), httpx (BSD-3-Clause), trafilatura (Apache-2.0),
    pypdf (BSD-3-Clause), playwright (Apache-2.0), websockets (BSD-3-Clause),
    python-multipart (Apache-2.0), PyJWT (MIT)

The dns image downloads the HaGeZi DNS blocklist (GPL-3.0) at start and once
a day.
